'''Nuclear Dragon King Berius''' (核刃龍キングベリウス, ''Kaku Ha Ryū Kingu Beriusu'')  was a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appeared in an [[Special Events|Event Stage]] exclusive to the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]]. He no longer exists because the PC version is discontinued as of January 31st, 2019.

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nuclear Dragon King Berius
|image = E ???.png
|money drop = >14,235¢
}}

==Enemy==
A long-ranged enemy with lowish damage and an occasional Knockback effect. He mainly served as support for a [[Maawth]], [[Nimoy Bore]], [[LeMurr]] and [[Elizabeth the LVIth]].

==Strategy==
'''''Note: His Health is an unknown value.'''''

Nuclear Dragon King Berius seems to have pretty decent attack power and range but has a mediocre attack frequency. Peon support in its stage would, funnily enough, be more of a threat than the main boss. The Knockback chance also doesn't really matter as it won't happen often due to the long delay between attacks. Overall it does not seem like he poses a big threat.

