==Trivia==
*Berius' name may have been taken from [[wikipedia:Naberius|Naberius]], a powerful demon appearing as a three-headed dog or raven.
*He was the only known enemy to be exclusive to the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].
*He was the first enemy to be a counterpart of a non-collab [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]].

